tus line now reads draft 2, with Hugh's words and this verdict.\n\nMain moved to 4322cb36 after the base. The two landings add notes only. `git diff 12cb8fa7 origin/main` is empty for every source and doc path that the five notes cite.\n\nChecks at the head: `node scripts/check-notes.mjs 12cb8fa7 HEAD` (0 warnings), `node scripts/check-doc-links.mjs` (1264 local links checked, 0 broken), `node scripts/check-commit-messages.mjs 12cb8fa7 HEAD` (2 checked, 0 flagged), `git diff --check` (clean). Only paths under notes/ change, so no gate is run.","body":{"artifact":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:93b69a68849bdeefb76890bdcf51b78ff01c091a","branch":"planner/security-properties-notes-20261123","conditions":"Independent exact-head review of b4cb1893…6dd1882 with explicit Architecture, Security and Simplification conclusions, filed with gs review naming git:sha1…01c091a first and resting on all 5 artifacts.","head":"b4cb189335a80ae730ec8414f32c81f3f6dd1882","no_git_artifact":"true","to":"4817b532e7a1a118634cb7947b05f7d5d16f726c9d30ea22ff7eaf7db3634e80"}}